    "title": "Tarrant County Jail inmate dies during medical emergency after refusing medical screening, officials say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amber Kite ,\n8 hours ago A 40-year-old man died at JPS Hospital after suffering a medical emergency in his Tarrant County Jail cell on Monday, just one day after being booked. Authorities stated that after being booked Sunday on a bond violation charge, the inmate refused to cooperate with or consent to routine medical assessments. Read full article",
